      "id": "claim_96c6150d94634eb995b0629ce730bfe6",
      "statement": "FilesystemMiddleware proactively evicts tool-result text only when it exceeds its configured character-derived threshold; it writes the full text to a sanitized tool-call path, returns a recoverable pointer-and-preview replacement only after a successful backend write, and otherwise keeps the original message.",
